memory last asked alloc_hard for ($FC14/$FC15) and not the block's; the type, 6, a sound; and the number, 1. On the disk the same four bytes are the resource's header: its size, $0436 (1,078 bytes), a 0 and the check byte","t":"byte","b":[0,255,6,1]},{"a":49924,"l":"music_start","c":"Starts tune A, called by startMusic ($57B1) with the chips banked in. Keeps the tune's number ($44A6) and address ($A9/$AA and $44AD/$44AE, from the sound tables at $74C0 and $7441), keeps the frame interrupt out of the sound engine while it works ($FC31), turns the music off and stops every sound (reset_sound), counts the tune once more as in use ($753F), builds the note lengths from the tune's tempo, its byte 5 (music_build_lengths), and sets up each voice its byte 4 names (music_voice_start). Then turns the music on ($43E8), takes every voice off the filter and keeps its resonance ($43DF), reads each voice's first note at once (music_frame), lets the interrupt back in and sets $FC32, which sound_frame waits for before it begins the sounds on its list","t":"code","b":[141,166,68],"m":"sta","oa":17574,"o":"a_44A6"},{"a":49927,"t":"code","b":[170],"m":"tax"},{"a":49928,"t":"code","b":[189,65,116],"m":"lda","oa":29761,"o":"f_7441,x"},{"a":49931,"t":"code","b":[133,170],"m":"sta","oa":170,"o":"zpa_AA"},{"a":49933,"t":"code","b":[141,174,68],"m":"sta","oa":17582,"o":"$44AE"},{"a":49936,"t":"code","b":[189,192,116],"m":"lda","oa":29888,"o":"f_74C0,x"},{"a":49939,"t":"code","b":[133,169],"m":"sta","oa":169,"o":"zpa_A9"},{"a":49941,"t":"code","b":[141,173,68],"m":"sta","oa":17581,"o":"$44AD"},{"a":49944,"t":"code","b":[238,49,252],"m":"inc","oa":64561,"o":"a_FC31"},{"a":49947,"t":"code","b":[169,0],"m":"lda","o":"#$00"},{"a":49949,"t":"code","b":[141,232,67],"m":"sta","oa":17384,"o":"a_43E8"},{"a":49952,"t":"code","b":[32,147,64],"m":"jsr","oa":16531,"o":"reset_sound"},{"a":49955,"t":"code","b":[174,166,68],"m":"ldx","oa":17574,"o":"a_44A6"},{"a":49958,"t":"code","b":[254,63,117],"m":"inc","o