e tune again, which the heap may have moved (music_find_tune), and reads the voice's next event. Its first byte is the note, a pitch from the table at $C673 and $C6D4, or $FF for a rest, or 0 for the end of the voice's part (music_voice_end). The second is the length, an index into the table music_build_lengths made. Up to two more may follow, each an instrument for the voice (bit 6 clear) or a value for variable 17 (bit 6 set, in its low six bits); bit 7 marks an event's last byte. A new instrument is copied into the voice's sound; the pitch and the length go into the sound's first command, its gate set for a note and cleared for a rest; then the engine starts the sound's voice part and its pulse width part on the voice's two channels (start_channel)","t":"code","b":[160,2],"m":"ldy","o":"#$02","x":[50007]},{"a":50071,"l":"j_C397","t":"code","b":[140,159,68],"m":"sty","oa":17567,"o":"$449F","x":[50153,50611]},{"a":50074,"t":"code","b":[173,233,67],"m":"lda","oa":17385,"o":"a_43E9"},{"a":50077,"t":"code","b":[57,90,67],"m":"and","oa":17242,"o":"f_435A,y"},{"a":50080,"t":"code","b":[208,3],"m":"bne","oa":50085,"o":"b_C3A5"},{"a":50082,"t":"code","b":[76,173,197],"m":"jmp","oa":50605,"o":"music_next_voice"},{"a":50085,"l":"b_C3A5","t":"code","b":[173,224,67],"m":"lda","oa":17376,"o":"a_43E0","x":[50080]},{"a":50088,"t":"code","b":[57,90,67],"m":"and","oa":17242,"o":"f_435A,y"},{"a":50091,"t":"code","b":[240,3],"m":"beq","oa":50096,"o":"b_C3B0"},{"a":50093,"t":"code","b":[76,173,197],"m":"jmp","oa":50605,"o":"music_next_voice"},{"a":50096,"l":"b_C3B0","t":"code","b":[152],"m":"tya","x":[50091]},{"a":50097,"t":"code","b":[72],"m":"pha"},{"a":50098,"t":"code","b":[32,22,198],"m":"jsr","oa":50710,"o":"music_find_tune"},{"a":50101,"t":"code","b":[104],"m":"pla"},{"a":50102,"t":"code","b":[168],"m":"tay"},{"a":50103,"t":"code","b":[185,167,68],"m":"lda","oa":17575,"o":"$44A7,y"},{"a":50106,"t":"code","b":[133,172],"m":"sta","oa":172,"o":"$AC"},{"a":50108,"t":"code","b":[185